00:08:28.855 --> 00:08:30.775
These regulations are modeled

00:08:31.095 --> 00:08:33.255
after the regulations

00:08:33.255 --> 00:08:34.775
that Columbia has in effect.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:36.670
