00:12:09.735 --> 00:12:12.375
There we'd be looking at a 7.5%

00:12:12.375 --> 00:12:15.815
reduction, a little further away, not as crucial that we

00:12:16.295 --> 00:12:17.495
make

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:23.420
as much a reduction is we do with the Zone A folks.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.820
And when we get into the septic tank

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.420
discussion,

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.620
