So if we get a two inch storm

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:20.060
and you've increased

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.780
the imperviousness,

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:28.780
which means the quality of not allowing fluid to pass through it, soak into the ground,

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:32.780
like you put, you know, one of the examples we're going to use is

00:16:33.135 --> 00:16:38.575
the partridges over on Lakeside Drive are going to put in a 400 square foot shed.

00:16:39.135 --> 00:16:40.175
We would expect

00:16:40.415 --> 00:16:41.135
that

00:16:42.415 --> 00:16:44.015
two inches off

00:16:44.255 --> 00:16:46.175
