Your lot is whatever size. It's so small and there's just nothing you can do down there. Now that I understand dry wells a little better, I'm not sure that that would ever be the case, but if somebody comes up with one,

00:43:55.925 --> 00:43:56.965
the regulations

00:43:57.125 --> 00:43:59.045
give us the latitude

00:43:59.525 --> 00:44:00.405
that

