00:44:25.695 --> 00:44:30.095
What if the land to be developed is not in the watershed? We talked about that earlier. They go to Jim.

00:44:31.130 --> 00:44:35.210
Jim agrees that, yep, I agree, it's not in the watershed. You don't have to

00:44:35.530 --> 00:44:39.050
