Since the wooded lot is the best lot there is,

00:45:00.185 --> 00:45:01.690
it's soaking up rainwater,

00:45:01.690 --> 00:45:06.890
minimizing that runoff into the lake, how are we ever gonna get 10% better than that?

00:45:07.850 --> 00:45:09.210
We can't.

00:45:09.850 --> 00:45:10.890
And so

00:45:16.905 --> 00:45:20.825
my thinking was, well, we talked about it. At that point,

