we will give them a credit of 2,000 square foot of roof, 3,000 square foot of paved surface, and 10,000 square foot of lawn.

00:45:31.870 --> 00:45:37.070
And my concern at the time was we've got all different sizes of lots.

00:45:39.230 --> 00:45:41.950
And so maybe if you've got a

00:45:42.755 --> 00:45:45.715
quarter acre lot or smaller,

00:45:46.835 --> 00:45:51.155
2,000 square feet of roof, 3,000 square feet of driveway is a little much.

