Maybe that's good for the bigger one. So what I tried to do here

00:46:00.310 --> 00:46:01.110
was

00:46:02.230 --> 00:46:04.070
go through and

00:46:05.110 --> 00:46:06.710
I put if lot

00:46:07.270 --> 00:46:09.990
to be developed is less than a half acre in size,

