00:46:22.875 --> 00:46:23.995
and 7,500

00:46:23.995 --> 00:46:24.875
square feet of lawn.

00:46:25.920 --> 00:46:28.720
Anything above that, you have to go and mitigate.

00:46:29.840 --> 00:46:30.960
I just

00:46:31.680 --> 00:46:35.120
ratioed the numbers up by put one half acre

00:46:35.120 --> 00:46:38.640
to an acre, one to two acres, and greater than two acres.

00:46:39.360 --> 00:46:41.040
So

00:46:40.405 --> 00:46:41.845
my recommendation

00:46:41.845 --> 00:46:43.045
