And

00:48:50.750 --> 00:48:51.630
we put

00:48:52.030 --> 00:48:52.830
in

00:48:52.830 --> 00:48:55.390
our current regs, way they're written out, it says

00:48:55.895 --> 00:48:57.735
don't apply fertilizer within

00:48:58.295 --> 00:49:00.135
20 feet of the lake or the stream.

00:49:01.575 --> 00:49:02.535
And I said,

00:49:03.495 --> 00:49:04.935
if I had my way,

00:49:05.175 --> 00:49:07.335
people on the lake wouldn't use any fertilizer at all.

00:49:08.300 --> 00:49:11.180
And so that's what I'll ask for, don't use fertilizer.

00:49:11.580 --> 00:49:14.780
