00:49:15.020 --> 00:49:18.220
But anytime you're putting fertilizer on the lake,

00:49:18.540 --> 00:49:20.140
it's not going to help the lake.

00:49:20.915 --> 00:49:23.955
And I don't care if it's the organic stuff, whatever.

