If it makes your grass green, it makes the lake green too.

00:49:27.555 --> 00:49:28.835
And that's

00:49:28.835 --> 00:49:30.195
not what we're looking for.

00:49:32.115 --> 00:49:34.995
One of the items was only use non phosphate fertilizer.

00:49:35.890 --> 00:49:41.250
I think the only fertilizer you can buy now is non phosphate. That's true.

00:49:41.490 --> 00:49:42.290
And so

00:49:43.890 --> 00:49:47.490
one of the things that when we wrote our regulations,

00:49:47.810 --> 00:49:49.730
talked about nitrogen and phosphate.

00:49:50.505 --> 00:49:53.945
The other ingredient that's still in fertilizer is nitrogen.

00:49:54.105 --> 00:49:55.065
And so again,

00:49:55.625 --> 00:49:57.785
I will update the words to

00:49:58.265 --> 00:50:00.105
put low nitrogen

00:50:00.185 --> 00:50:01.305
fertilizer

00:50:01.705 --> 00:50:02.665
on there

